Package: kulan-devkit
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), git, python3, python3-pip, python3-venv, build-essential, docker.io, docker-compose, curl
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ developer kit
 One-click developer setup for @NAME@: Git, Python with pip and virtual
 environments, the C/C++ build tools, Docker with Docker Compose, and curl.
 .
 Install it from the Welcome app, or with: sudo apt install kulan-devkit
